    "https://www.westminster.edu/deposit": {
      "title": "Deposit / Admissions & Aid / Westminster College",
      "description": "Deposit / Admissions & Aid / Westminster College Skip to main content INQUIRE VISIT APPLY MAJORS GIVE INQUIRE VISIT APPLY MAJORS GIVE Search About Overview & Quick Facts The Westminster Story Mission Leadership Strategic Plan Accreditation & Assessment Student Right to Know Titan Spotlights Employment The Westminster Brand Directions & Contact Interactive Campus Map Academics Academics Home Majors & Minors Graduate Programs Schools & Departments First-Year Summer Reading Program Inquiry Sections The Westminster Plan Experiences & Opportunities Student Academic Resources Admissions & Aid Admissions Home How to Apply Visit Paying Your Deposit Scholarships & Aid Admitted Students Transfer Students Early College / Dual Enrollment International Students Graduate Admissions Admissions Team Request Information Net Price Calculator Titan Athletics Student Life Student Life Home Clubs & Organizations Housing & Residence Life Dining & Meal Plans Health & Wellness Campus Recreation Public Safety Faith & Spirituality Student Affairs Staff What to Bring Student Media News & Events News & Events Home Rankings Campus Calendar Publications Titan Spotlights Resources for Students, Faculty & Staff Events Calendar Library PDCE Drinko Center Registrar Faculty Resources Dining Menu Marketing Form Email Login D2L my.Westminster Academic Calendar College Catalog UG Course Schedule Student Handbook Help Desk/PPO Portal Alumni, Parents & Friends Office of Alumni Engagement Alumni History Project Alumni Events Support Titans Alumni Communications Alumni Council Update Your Alumni Record Nominate for an award Student Scholarships Get Involved Services for alumni Campus Store Parent Resources & Family Day Athletics LiveStream Community Arts & Cultural Events Celebrity Series Foster Art Gallery Performance Venues Athletic Events Planetarium McGill Library Science in Motion – Admissions & Aid / Deposit Admissions & Aid Make a Deposit Depositing to Westminster Submitting the deposit* is the next step to becoming a Titan.  Please select one of the three options below: 1. Submit your deposit through the portal. Use the email address you used when you applied to Westminster and your password. Deposit through the portal 2. Call Admissions We are happy to take the deposit over the phone and process the debit or credit card payment for you. (724) 946-7100 Office Hours:  Monday – Friday 8:00 am – 4:30 pm 3. To pay by check, please make the check payable to Westminster College and include the student’s first and last name in the memo line. Mail checks to: Office of Admission 319 S. Market St New Wilmington, PA 16172 *Enrollment deposits are non-refundable Deposit Deadlines Early Decision If your first choice is Westminster, you are encouraged to apply Early Decision and make your senior year of high school stress-free.  Early Decision allows you early access to figure out your financial aid offer, housing, roommate and class schedule, easing your transition into a great first year of college.  Early Decision plans are binding — a student who is accepted must attend Westminster and withdraw applications to other colleges. Application Deadline: November 1 Enrollment Deposit Deadline: January 15 Apply Early Action If you want an early answer on your application status but need more time before committing to Westminster, apply Early Action.  Early Action plans are nonbinding — students receive an early response to their application but do not have to commit to the college until the normal reply date. Application Deadline: December 15 (May be eligible for $2,000 Early Application Grant) Enrollment Deposit Deadline: May 1 Apply Rolling Admission Rolling Admission begins December 1st with notification as soon as the application materials are received and reviewed.  A $200 deposit is due by May 1st. Students who apply after March 1st will be admitted based on space availability in the new first-year class. Application Deadline: March 1 (students applying after March 1 will be admitted based on availablity in first-year class) Enrollment Deposit Deadline: May 1 Apply *Enrollment deposit match grant available until April 1 Westminster College 319 South Market Street New Wilmington, PA 16172 724-946-7999 Office of Admissions admissions@westminster.edu 724-946-7100 Directory of Offices Maps & Directions Report an Incident Title IX Compliance Accreditation & Assessment Marketing Form Employment Sitemap • Privacy This website collects information to improve your experience. Data Privacy Statement OK"
    },
